litematica.hover.button.schematic_placement_settings.enclosing_box.on=包围盒渲染：§a开启
litematica.hover.button.schematic_placement_settings.grid_settings=按住 §eShift§r 可仅切换网格重复 §a开§r/§c关§r
litematica.hover.button.schematic_placement_settings.lock=锁定放置可防止（意外地）移动或以其他方式更改它
